    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Correspondences with the DPV: is close to dpv:WithdrawConsent. Bridge with the GDPR: is close to gdprtext:CanBeWithdrawnEasilyConsentObligation (through dpv:WithdrawConsent); is close to gdprtext:WithdrawingConsent (through dpv:WithdrawConsent)."
