  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Facultad voluntaria de adherirse a códigos de conducta y certificaciones sin eximir la responsabilidad legal."
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "http://www.semanticweb.org/profiles/ecuador-lopdp#TechnicalAndLegalMeasures",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://purl.org/dc/terms/source" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "LOPDP, art. 65"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Correspondences with the DPV: is the same as dpv:TechnicalOrganisationalMeasure; is a kind of dpv:LegalMeasure; is a kind of dpv:TechnicalMeasure."
  }, {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Correspondencias con el DPV: es igual a dpv:TechnicalOrganisationalMeasure; es un tipo de dpv:LegalMeasure; es un tipo de dpv:TechnicalMeasure."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "medidas técnicas, jurídicas, organizativas o administrativas"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broadMatch" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/dpv#LegalMeasure"
  }, {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/dpv#TechnicalMeasure"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Imposición de medidas para garantizar un tratamiento adecuado de los datos personales."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch" : [ {
    "@id" : "https://w3id.org/dpv#TechnicalOrganisationalMeasure"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "http://www.semanticweb.org/profiles/ecuador-lopdp#UnfulfilledRegistry",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Registro Único de Responsables y Encargados Incumplidos"
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Registro de responsables y encargados del tratamiento de datos personales que han incurrido en infracciones, con fines sociales, estadísticos, preventivos y de capacitación."
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "http://www.semanticweb.org/profiles/ontopriv-gdpr-alignment#chainedBy",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty" ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Término del DPV con el que se corresponden los dos conceptos del par."
  } ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "encadenado por el DPV"
  } ]
}, {
  "@id" : "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broadMatch",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty" ]
}, {
  "@id" : "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#closeMatch",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty" ]
}, {
  "@id" : "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty" ]
}, {
  "@id" : "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty" ]
}, {
  "@id" : "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrowMatch",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty" ]
}, {
  "@id" : "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#relatedMatch",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty" ]
}, {
  "@id" : "https://elian18.github.io/ontology-integration-transformer/",
  "@type" : [ "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology" ],
  "http://purl.org/dc/terms/abstract" : [ {
    "@language" : "es",
    "@value" : "Base de conocimiento legal construida a partir de OntoPriv y de la Ley Orgánica de Protección de Datos Personales del Ecuador (LOPDP), alineada con el Data Privacy Vocabulary (DPV) y enlazada con el GDPR por medio de GDPRtEXT."
  }, {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Legal knowledge base built from OntoPriv and Ecuador's Organic Law on Personal Data Protection (LOPDP), aligned with the Data Privacy Vocabulary (DPV) and linked to the GDPR through GDPRtEXT."
  } ],
  "http://purl.org/dc/terms/bibliographicCitation" : [ {
    "@value" : "E. A. Gavilanes Miranda, «Base de conocimiento legal de privacidad: OntoPriv-LOPDP alineada con el DPV y el GDPR», versión 1.1.0, Escuela Politécnica Nacional, 2026."
  } ],
  "http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator" : [ {
    "@id" : "_:genid1"
  } ],
  "http://purl.org/dc/terms/description" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "Brings together in one document the four modules of the base: the reusable core (OntoPriv-Core), the Ecuador profile (LOPDP), the alignment with the DPV approved by human review and the bridge with the GDPR (GDPRtEXT). Based on OntoPriv, by G. Suntaxi, K. Ojeda and F. Rodríguez (CLEI 2024), and on its DPV-based version, by G. Suntaxi, K. Ojeda, F. Rodríguez, P. del Hierro, J. Miño and D. A. Flores (2025). The sentence of each concept with its correspondences is written only for this documentation; the modules of the repository do not have it. Some terms of OntoPriv have two types at once, for example class and property (OWL Full): their entry does not show the sentence, but the table below does.\n\n### Correspondences of the base\n\n| Concept | DPV | GDPR | Articles of the LOPDP |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| [a data protection delegate will be assigned](#http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#a_data_protection_delegate_will_be_assigned) | is related to dpv:hasDataProtectionOfficer |  |  |\n| [Administrative or judicial authorities](#http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#Administrative_or_judicial_authorities) | is a kind of dpv:Authority |  |  |\n| [Admitted Countries](#http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#Admitted_Countries) | is a kind of dpv:Country |  |  |\n| [Advise on risk analysis](#http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#Advise_on_risk_analysis) | is related to dpv:hasRiskAssessment |  |  |\n| [affects to](#http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#affects_to) | is close to dpv:hasImpactOn |  |  |\n| [Anonymization](#http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#Anonymization) | is the same as dpv:Anonymisation |  | art. 4, art. 31 |\n| [Anonymized data](#http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#Anonymized_data) | is close to dpv:AnonymisedData | is close to gdprtext:AnonymousData |  |\n| [Applicability](#http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#Applicability) | is related to dpv:Applicability |  |  |\n| [Applicable safety measures](#http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#Applicable_safety_measures) | is close to dpv:TechnicalOrganisationalMeasure |  | art. 41 |\n| [auditorías de protección de datos](#http://www.semanticweb.org/profiles/ecuador-lopdp#DataProtectionAudit) | is the same as dpv:PersonalDataAudit |  | art. 58 |\n| [Authorization for international transfer](#http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#Authorization_for_international_transfer) | is related to dpv:AuthorisationProcedure |  |  |\n| [Authorized consent](#http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#Authorized_consent) | is a kind of dpv:Consent |  |  |\n| [Autorregulación](#http://www.semanticweb.org/profiles/ecuador-lopdp#SelfRegulation) | is a kind of dpv:CertificationSeal |  | art. 52 |\n| [Biometric data](#http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#Biometric_data) | is a kind of dpv:SensitivePersonalData |  | art. 4 |\n| [Boys and girls](#http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#Boys_and_girls) | is the same as dpv:Child |  |  |\n| [can be rights of](#http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#can_be_rights_of) | is related to dpv:hasRight |  |  |\n| [Certifying entity](#http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#Certifying_entity) | is related to dpv:Certification |  | art. 54 |\n| [cese del tratamiento](#http://www.semanticweb.org/profiles/ecuador-lopdp#CessationOfTreatment) | is broader than dpv:UntilTimeDuration |  | art. 65 |\n| [Claims defense](#http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#Claims_defense) | is related to dpv:DisputeManagement |  |  |\n| [Collection](#http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#Collection) | is close to dpv:Collect |  |  |\n| [Commercial](#http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#Commercial) | is related to dpv:CommercialPurpose |  |  |\n| [Confidentiality](#http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#Confidentiality) | is related to dpv:ConfidentialData |  | art. 10, art. 50 |\n| [Consent](#http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#Consent) | is the same as dpv:Consent | is close to gdprtext:Consent; is close to gdprtext:ConsentActivity; is close to gdprtext:GivenConsent | art. 4, art. 33 |\n| [Conservation](#http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#Conservation) | is related to dpv:StorageDuration |  | art. 10 |\n| [contact data](#http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#contact_data) | is close to dpv:hasContact |  |  |\n| [contratos de confidencialidad](#http://www.semanticweb.org/profiles/ecuador-lopdp#ConfidentialityAgreement) | is the same as dpv:ConfidentialityAgreement | is close to gdprtext:ImposeConfidentialityObligationOnPersonnel | art. 47 |\n| [Credit data](#http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#Credit_data) | is a kind of dpv:PersonalData |  | art. 28 |\n| [códigos de conducta](#http://www.semanticweb.org/profiles/ecuador-lopdp#CodesOfConduct) | is the same as dpv:CodeOfConduct | is close to gdprtext:CodeOfConduct | art. 53 |\n| [Data base](#http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#Data_base) | is related to dpv:Data |  | art. 4 |\n| [Data Controller](#http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#Data_Controller) | is the same as dpv:DataController | is close to gdprtext:Controller | art. 4, art. 9, art. 17, art. 33, art. 41, art. 49, art. 57, art. 67 |\n| [Data Owner](#http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#Data_Owner) | is the same as dpv:DataSubject | is close to gdprtext:DataSubject | art. 4, art. 10, art. 17, art. 33 |\n| [Data persons minors](#http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#Data_persons_minors) | is a kind of dpv:PersonalData |  |  |\n| [Data processing](#http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#Data_processing) | is the same as dpv:Processing | is close to gdprtext:AutomatedProcessing; is close to gdprtext:Processing |  |\n| [Data Processor](#http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#Data_Processor) | is the same as dpv:DataProcessor | is close to gdprtext:Processor | art. 4, art. 10, art. 34, art. 41, art. 49, art. 57, art. 69 |\n| [Data protection mechanisms](#http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#Data_protection_mechanisms) | is related to dpv:DataSecurityManagement |  |  |\n| [Data Seniors data](#http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#Data_Seniors_data) | is related to dpv:ElderlyDataSubject |  |  |\n| [Data types](#http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#Data_types) | is close to dpv:Data | is close to gdprtext:Data |  |\n| [Data under 17 years old](#http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#Data_under_17_years_old) | is a kind of dpv:PersonalData |  |  |\n| [deadline in days for the right of access](#http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#deadline_in_days_for_the_right_of_access) | is a kind of dpv:hasDuration |  |  |\n| [deadline in days for the right to oppose opposition](#http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#deadline_in_days_for_the_right_to_oppose_opposition) | is a kind of dpv:hasDuration |  |  |\n| [Deber de confidencialidad](#http://www.semanticweb.org/profiles/ecuador-lopdp#DutyOfConfidentiality) | is related to dpv:ContractConfidentialityClause |  | art. 30 |\n| [Deceased persons data](#http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#Deceased_persons_data) | is a kind of dpv:PersonalData |  |  |\n| [Deceased persons data](#http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#Deceased_persons_data) | is a kind of dpv:PersonalData |  |  |\n| [Delegate](#http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#Delegate) | is the same as dpv:DataProtectionOfficer |  | art. 4, art. 48, art. 49 |\n| [Derecho de niñas, niños y adolescentes a no ser objeto de una decisión basada única o parcialmente en valoraciones automatizadas](#http://www.semanticweb.org/profiles/ecuador-lopdp#MinorAutomatedDecisionRight) | is a kind of dpv:DataSubjectRight; is related to dpv:AutomatedDecisionMaking |  | art. 21 |\n| [Disabled owner data](#http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#Disabled_owner_data) | is a kind of dpv:PersonalData |  |  |\n| [Domestic Companies](#http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#Domestic_Companies) | is a kind of dpv:Organisation |  |  |\n| [duration of charge](#http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#duration_of_charge) | is a kind of dpv:hasDuration |  |  |\n| [eliminación de los datos](#http://www.semanticweb.org/profiles/ecuador-lopdp#DataDeletion) | is the same as dpv:Delete; is related to dpv:DataDeletionPolicy |  | art. 65 |\n| [Epidemiological studies](#http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#Epidemiological_studies) | is a kind of dpv:ScientificResearch |  |  |\n| [evaluación de impacto del tratamiento de datos personales](#http://www.semanticweb.org/profiles/ecuador-lopdp#ImpactAssessment) | is the same as dpv:ImpactAssessment | is close to gdprtext:FactorsForImpactAssessment; is close to gdprtext:ImpactAssessment | art. 42 |\n| [excepciones a la notificación de vulneración](#http://www.semanticweb.org/profiles/ecuador-lopdp#DataBreachException) | is broader than dpv:DataBreachNotice |  | art. 46 |\n| [Exceptions for international transfers or communications](#http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#Exceptions_for_international_transfers_or_communications) | is close to dpv:DataTransferLegalBasis |  |  |\n| [Exceptions to consent for national transfers](#http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#Exceptions_to_consent_for_national_transfers) | is related to dpv:DataTransferLegalBasis |  |  |\n| [Exercise of rights](#http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#Exercise_of_rights) | is close to dpv:RightExerciseActivity | is close to gdprtext:ExerciseRights | art. 24 |\n| [Follow up from design](#http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#Follow-up_from_design) | is close to dpv:PrivacyByDesign | is close to gdprtext:DataProtectionByDesignAndByDefault; is close to gdprtext:PrivacyByDesign | art. 39, art. 47 |\n| [for different purpose](#http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#for_different_purpose) | is related to dpv:hasPurpose |  |  |\n| [for plurality of purposes](#http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#for_plurality_of_purposes) | is related to dpv:hasPurpose |  |  |\n| [Genetic data](#http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#Genetic_data) | is a kind of dpv:PersonalData |  | art. 4 |\n| [Governmental information security mechanism](#http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#Governmental_information_security_mechanism) | is related to dpv:InformationSecurityPolicy |  | art. 38 |\n| [has as the basis of](#http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#has_as_the_basis_of) | is close to dpv:hasLegalBasis |  |  |\n| [Health Related Data](#http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#Health_Related_Data) | is a kind of dpv:PersonalData |  | art. 30 |\n| [Health related data processing](#http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#Health_related_data_processing) | is a kind of dpv:PersonalDataProcess |  |  |\n| [Holder between 15 to 17 years old](#http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#Holder_between_15_to_17_years_old) | is a kind of dpv:Child |  |  |\n| [Holder over 17 years old](#http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#Holder_over_17_years_old) | is a kind of dpv:Adult |  |  |\n| [Holder under 15 years old](#http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#Holder_under_15_years_old) | is a kind of dpv:Child |  |  |\n| [Holder with disability](#http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#Holder_with_disability) | is related to dpv:VulnerableDataSubject |  |  |\n| [Impact assessment](#http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#Impact_assessment) | is close to dpv:hasImpactAssessment |  |  |\n| [Inapplicability](#http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#Inapplicability) | is related to dpv:Applicability |  |  |\n| [Informe de riesgo](#http://www.semanticweb.org/profiles/ecuador-lopdp#RiskReport) | is close to dpv:RiskAssessment; is a kind of dpv:RiskConcept |  | art. 9 |\n| [Informed](#http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#Informed) | is related to dpv:hasInformedStatus |  |  |\n| [International](#http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#International) | is a kind of dpv:Transfer |  | art. 55, art. 57 |\n| [International companies](#http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#International_companies) | is a kind of dpv:Organisation |  |  |\n| [is authorized by](#http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#is_authorized_by) | is related to dpv:hasAuthority |  |  |\n| [is implemented by](#http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#is_implemented_by) | is close to dpv:isImplementedByEntity |  |  |\n| [Juridicity](#http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#Juridicity) | is related to dpv:Lawfulness |  | art. 10 |\n| [justification for revocation](#http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#justification_for_revocation) | is a kind of dpv:hasJustification |  |  |\n| [Large scale treatment](#http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#Large_scale_treatment) | is a kind of dpv:hasProcessingScale |  |  |\n| [Legal](#http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#Legal) | is related to dpv:LegalMeasure |  |  |\n| [Legal institutions](#http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#Legal_institutions) | is related to dpv:JudicialOrganisation |  |  |\n| [Legal interest](#http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#Legal_interest) | is the same as dpv:LegitimateInterest | is close to gdprtext:LegitimateInterest | art. 9 |\n| [Legal or regulatory obligation](#http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#Legal_or_regulatory_obligation) | is related to dpv:hasObligation |  |  |\n| [Legal persons data](#http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#Legal_persons_data) | is a kind of dpv:NonPersonalData |  |  |\n| [Legal relationship](#http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#Legal_relationship) | is related to dpv:Contract |  |  |\n| [Legal representative owner](#http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#Legal_representative_owner) | is close to dpv:GuardianOfDataSubject |  |  |\n| [Legality](#http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#Legality) | is related to dpv:Lawful |  |  |\n| [medidas técnicas, jurídicas, organizativas o administrativas](#http://www.semanticweb.org/profiles/ecuador-lopdp#TechnicalAndLegalMeasures) | is the same as dpv:TechnicalOrganisationalMeasure; is a kind of dpv:LegalMeasure; is a kind of dpv:TechnicalMeasure |  | art. 65 |\n| [Minor infractions](#http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#Minor_infractions) | is related to dpv:ObligationViolated |  | art. 67 |\n| [minor infractions](#http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#minor_infractions) | is related to dpv:hasSeverity |  |  |\n| [Métodos de eliminación](#http://www.semanticweb.org/profiles/ecuador-lopdp#DataDeletionMethods) | is the same as dpv:DataSanitisationTechnique; is broader than dpv:DataRedaction; is related to dpv:DataDeletionPolicy |  | art. 15 |\n| [Name](#http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#Name) | is close to dpv:hasName |  |  |\n| [National Scope](#http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#National_Scope) | is close to dpv:NationalScale |  |  |\n| [Need](#http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#Need) | is related to dpv:Necessity |  |  |\n| [need of](#http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#need_of) | is close to dpv:hasNecessity |  |  |\n| [nivel adecuado de protección](#http://www.semanticweb.org/profiles/ecuador-lopdp#AdequateProtectionLevel) | is related to dpv:DataProtectionAuthority |  | art. 56 |\n| [normas corporativas vinculantes](#http://www.semanticweb.org/profiles/ecuador-lopdp#BindingCorporateRules) | is a kind of dpv:LegalCompliance; is broader than dpv:ContractualTerms; is related to dpv:FulfilmentOfContractualObligation |  | art. 58 |\n| [Not informed](#http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#Not_informed) | is related to dpv:hasInformedStatus |  |  |\n| [Notification](#http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#Notification) | is a kind of dpv:Notification |  | art. 43 |\n| [obligations](#http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#obligations) | is close to dpv:hasObligation |  |  |\n| [Obligations of the responsible person and manager](#http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#Ob